<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_0a5b07262fb6deaea1305147b46e84b8a0e692c3bf4e3b142d88ada7ab765548_n0004/tu_0006> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Beta blockers\ncarvedilol, metoprolol succinate, metoprolol tartrate, bisoprolol, atenolol\nCoreg, Toprol XL, Lopressor, Zebeta, Tenormin\nSlow the heart rate (how fast the heart beats).\nReduce blood pressure.\nMake it easier for the heart to pump blood." .
