<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_0a5b07262fb6deaea1305147b46e84b8a0e692c3bf4e3b142d88ada7ab765548_n0004/tu_0011> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Sodium-glucose cotransporter-2 (SGLT2) Inhibitor\ndapagliflozin, empagliflozin\nFarxiga, Jardiance\nUsed to treat diabetes but are also to treat heart failure in people with or without diabetes to reduce hospitalization and death." .
